sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller as PlaceOrderAsync<br/>(decorator-wrapped)
    participant TS as TransactionScope<br/>(AsyncFlow=Enabled)
    participant DB as nopCommerce DB
    participant Outbox as OutboxMessage table
    participant Disp as Outbox Dispatcher<br/>(IScheduleTask)
    participant Bus as RabbitMQ
    participant Inv as Inventory Sync Service

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over Caller,Outbox: One transaction - atomic
    Caller->>TS: open scope
    Caller->>DB: insert Order
    Caller->>DB: insert OrderItems
    Caller->>Outbox: insert OrderPlaced row<br/>(state = Pending)
    Caller->>TS: Complete()
    DB-->>Caller: both rows or neither
    end

    Note over Disp,Bus: Out of band - eventually
    Disp->>Outbox: poll Pending rows
    Outbox-->>Disp: OrderPlaced
    Disp->>Bus: publish
    Bus-->>Disp: confirm
    Disp->>Outbox: mark Dispatched

    Bus->>Inv: deliver OrderPlaced
    Inv->>Inv: reserve stock /<br/>reject (idempotent on EventId)
    Inv->>Bus: StockReserved | ReservationRejected
